				""
				"The &dTrader&r block &o&ballows trading&r with the villager without having to &o&bdeal with securing&r the villager. Also allows the villager to &o&brestock in non-working hours&r. The restocking time of the villager is &nnot dependent&r on any external sources like &nday&r/&nnight&r time or &ndimension&r."
